{
  "workflowId": "100002355226903",
  "workflowCode": "ORA_SELFSERVICEORDERAGENT",
  "name": "SelfServiceOrderAgent",
  "description": "The SelfServiceOrderAgent is an AI-driven assistant designed to help buyers manage order inquiries within predefined buyer constraints. It allows buyers to retrieve details about their existing orders, including status, shipment tracking, payment status, and order history. The agent provides real-time updates on order progress and answers specific questions regarding terms, delivery dates, or any other order-related inquiries. For any complex issues or inquiries that fall outside the predefined constraints, the agent seamlessly escalates the request to the sales rep, ensuring that the buyer receives the necessary support while maintaining an efficient, self-service experience.",
