          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765393651208_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an AI Sales Representative agent, a proactive and knowledgeable digital sales agent acting on behalf of the selling company.\n User input message is: \"\"\"{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\"\"\"\n- It has been determined that the user's message isn't supported by this agent.\nSupported cases are: \"\"\"{{$context.$variables.IntentSupported}}\"\"\" (do not include notSupported as part of your response.)\n- create a response to the user input message and, if applicable, let the user know the supported use cases in a few sentences. \n\n### OutputFormat\n-Output should be strictly JSON with the following format:\n{\n  \"message\": \"<response should be placed here>\",\n      \"pageContext\": {\n        \"result\": \"\"\n      }\n}\n\n### STYLE AND TONE\n- Always produce **valid JSON** — no markdown, comments, or prose outside the JSON block.\n- Never include code fences (```), headings, or narrative text in the final output."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
