          "convergenceTargetId": "1769735343903",
          "id": "1759260182248",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1759260182250_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Based on the user input and buyer context, extract the relevant order information.\n\nInputs\nUser Input: \"\"\"{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\"\"\"\nChat History: \"\"\"{{$context.$system.$chatHistory}}\"\"\"\nBuyerContext: \"\"\"{{$context.$variables.buyerContext}}\"\"\"\n\nStep 1: Analyze the chat history and extract both user and agent interactions. From the agent responses, focus on the explanation property, which contains the actual message content.\n\nStep 2: Determine whether the user input is a continuation of the existing conversation or a new request.\n\nStep 3: Extract the product ID and quantity from the user. This can come directly from the user input or from the user selecting one of the available products.\nIf the user provides a semantic description of a product instead of a specific product ID, initiate product discovery. In this case, stop the flow and return the following values:\n\nresult → productDiscovery\nsearchKeyWord → semantic description provided by the user\nUse the buyer context to fill in other fields.\n\nStep 4: If the user is responding to a prompt to select a product from previously given results, extract the product ID and quantity from that response. If the user chooses a product but doesn't specify the quantity return with the following values\n  result → missingFeilds\n  missingFeilds -> quantity\n\nStep 5: If both the product ID and quantity are determined, set these values and:\n\nresult → createOrder\nFor pLines, output a plain string representing the JSON array of order lines. Each line must contain at least ProductId, OrderedUOMCode (default \"Ea\" if not provided), and OrderedQuantity.\nDo not use escape characters or backslashes within the string.\nExample:\n\"pLines\": \"[{ProductId:300100546393870, OrderedQuantity:5, OrderedUOMCode:Ea}]\"\n\nThe remaining values should be populated using the buyer’s context."
            },
            {
              "id": "1759260182250_2",
              "name": "temperature",
              "type": "number",
              "value": ""
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"pRequestedDate\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"format\": \"date-time\"\n    },\n    \"pBusinessUnitId\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"pPartyId\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"pTxnCurrencyCode\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"pAppliedCurrencyCode\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"pBillToPartyId\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"pBillToAccountId\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"pBillToAccountSiteUseId\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"pShipToPartyId\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"pShipToPartySiteId\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"pShipToContactId\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"pShipToContactPointId\": {\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\n    },\n    \"pLines\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"searchKeyWord\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    },\n    \"result\": {\n       \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"True if all required properties are extracted; false otherwise\"\n    },\n    \"missingFields\": {\n       \"type\": \"array\",\n       \"items\": { \"type\": \"string\" },\n       \"description\": \"List of missing required properties\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"pRequestedDate\",\n    \"pBusinessUnitId\",\n    \"pPartyId\",\n    \"pTxnCurrencyCode\",\n    \"pAppliedCurrencyCode\",\n    \"pBillToPartyId\",\n    \"pBillToAccountId\",\n    \"pBillToAccountSiteUseId\",\n    \"pShipToPartyId\",\n    \"pShipToPartySiteId\",\n    \"pShipToContactId\",\n    \"pShipToContactPointId\",\n     \"result\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
